{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2021-12-16 16:30:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., DEC. 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY), ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.11\xa0PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, AN INDICATED ANNUAL RATE OF\xa0$0.44\xa0PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 14, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2021.'}